# Enter the pinned Nix development shell (flake.nix, devShells.default)
# automatically when this directory is entered.
#
# Requires direnv (https://direnv.net) with its shell hook installed; run
# `direnv allow` once per checkout. Without direnv, prefix commands with
# `nix develop -c` instead. `use flake` re-evaluates whenever flake.nix or
# flake.lock changes; nix-direnv caches the shell if it is installed.
use flake
